# SOLARIUS OPS Tier 3 Frontend - Environment Configuration

# Tier 2 SaaS Control Plane Base URL (FastAPI Ingestion & AIOps backend)
NEXT_PUBLIC_TIER2_URL=http://localhost:8000

# Tier 1 Edge Collector Base URL (Local telemetry & outbox daemon)
NEXT_PUBLIC_TIER1_URL=http://localhost:8001

# SECURITY NOTICE:
# DO NOT store private bearer tokens, master API keys, or production secrets in NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
# Next.js compiles all NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables directly into client-side JavaScript bundles visible to end users.
# In production, bearer tokens are set at runtime via session storage or authenticated HTTP-only session cookies.
